  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "This meme relies on the harmful stereotype of comparing Black people to primates, which is a well-documented racist trope used to dehumanize and demean Black individuals. The visual of the woman with the baby gorilla, combined with the text 'she's pissed,' implicitly invokes this stereotype by suggesting the woman is acting like a 'pissed' primate, which is a degrading and racist comparison.",
